Package: chirpstack-gateway
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: @ARCH@
Description: ChirpStack Concentratord and MQTT Forwarder.
 The gateway half of ChirpStack: concentratord drives the SX130x, and
 mqtt-forwarder carries its frames to the cloud network server over MQTT.
 Upstream binaries, fetched and checksum-verified at build time; see
 feed/chirpstack-gateway/fetch.
